Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: support SM8450 CAMSS with separate CSI PHYs

Use the separate MIPI CSI2 PHY model and SM8450 CAMSS resource tables.
The controller is wired independently of sensor-specific camera pipelines.

CSI PHY, PHY node lookup and shared CAMSS interfaces use Linux commit
067c5c24cef23d913b67eaaf71ae67e7169a6620. Keep the PHY provider locking fixes
with the lookup helpers. Adapt allocation, graph iteration and V4L2 callbacks
to the locked 7.3.4 interfaces. The PHY provider locking and SA8775P
VFE-lite gcc_axi_hf clock changes are already in 7.3.4 and are not
reapplied. Add the missing node lookup helper and declarations using
the existing provider mutex ownership.

