+title: Qualcomm SM8450 Camera Subsystem (CAMSS)
+
+maintainers:
+  - Vladimir Zapolskiy <vz@kernel.org>
+
+description:
+  The CAMSS IP is a CSI decoder and ISP present on Qualcomm platforms.
